// MEM-17: clone selects the expected type through Box, Rc and Arc.
// clone_in requires a region value of the expected type.
// Resource, scoped and opaque owners cannot be cloned.

// expect: refuse MEM-17 at 15:30
// expect: refuse MEM-17 at 16:72
